# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Government Resolution No. 282
#   Approving submission of Cybersecurity Law complete restatement
#   and Administrative Offences Code amendment for NIS Directive
#   transposition to Seimas
#   2018-03-28, Vilnius
#   Prime Minister Saulius Skvernelis
# =================================================================

lld:GovRes-282-2018 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 282 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law restatement for NIS Directive transposition to Seimas (2018)" ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 282 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law restatement for NIS Directive transposition to Seimas (2018)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Vyriausybės nutarimas Nr. 282 – Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo naujos redakcijos teikimas Seimui dėl TIS direktyvos perkėlimo (2018)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas two draft laws: (1) Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 complete restatement, (2) Administrative Offences Code Arts. 479, 480, 589 and annex amendment. Requests urgent consideration because the drafts are prepared for timely transposition of Directive (EU) 2016/1148 (NIS Directive) on measures for a high common level of security of network and information systems across the Union. Delegates Defence Minister Raimundas Karoblis (deputy: Vice-Minister Edvinas Kerza) to represent Government in Seimas." ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas two draft laws: (1) Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 complete restatement, (2) Administrative Offences Code Arts. 479, 480, 589 and annex amendment. Requests urgent consideration because the drafts are prepared for timely transposition of Directive (EU) 2016/1148 (NIS Directive) on measures for a high common level of security of network and information systems across the Union. Delegates Defence Minister Raimundas Karoblis (deputy: Vice-Minister Edvinas Kerza) to represent Government in Seimas."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Vyriausybė pritaria ir teikia Seimui du įstatymų projektus: (1) Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo Nr. XII-1428 pakeitimo (nauja redakcija), (2) Administracinių nusižengimų kodekso 479, 480, 589 straipsnių ir priedo pakeitimo. Prašo svarstyti skubos tvarka, nes projektai parengti siekiant laiku perkelti Direktyvą (ES) 2016/1148 (TIS direktyvą) dėl priemonių aukštam bendram tinklų ir informacinių sistemų saugumo lygiui visoje Sąjungoje užtikrinti. Įgalioja krašto apsaugos ministrą Raimundą Karoblį atstovauti Seime."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. 282" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2018-03-28"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true .
